{"id":"d1b4d95570b7386b","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-theory.md","title":"语义闭理论","display":"df-theory — 语义闭理论","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-theory","aliases":["43-df-theory"],"display":"df-theory — 语义闭理论","depends_on":["[[43-df-sentence]]","[[43-df-satisfaction]]","[[43-df-logical-consequence]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目","source_scope":"local-support","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-theory — 语义闭理论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1be181e56e937ecb\" href=\"?note=1be181e56e937ecb\" title=\"43-df-sentence\">43-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3238d7fca6c27a3f\" href=\"?note=3238d7fca6c27a3f\" title=\"43-df-satisfaction\">43-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e2311665721b3454\" href=\"?note=e2311665721b3454\" title=\"43-df-logical-consequence\">43-df-logical-consequence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-support"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1\">\\(L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1\\)</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,L)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Theory}_L(T)\\Longleftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_L\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_L\\ (T\\models_L\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\varphi\\in T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Theory}_L(T)\\Longleftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_L\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_L\\ (T\\models_L\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\varphi\\in T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Th}(\\mathfrak A):=\\{\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_L:\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Th}(\\mathfrak A):=\\{\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_L:\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>修正标题“Recursion Theory”与实际一阶理论内容不符的问题。此处采用语义闭理论约定，不把任意公理集合自动称为闭理论。</p>\n<p>来源：本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。 此项为支撑原有形式化的一阶逻辑基础，非声称原书有独立同名定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1be181e56e937ecb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3238d7fca6c27a3f","anchor":"ref-2"